{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:43 2026-06-29 HKT</p>\n\n<p>葵涌今日（6月29日）下午4時半左右有熱心市民報案，表示有一隻雪橇犬在炎熱天氣底下，被綁在石蔭路63號金祿樓天台上，無法四處走動，且身上毛髮甩脫，懷疑遭人虐待。警方接報到場調查，愛護動物協會亦到場協助。其後刑事調查隊探員到場，進一步調查後將女狗主帶上警車，愛協亦用狗籠將將狗隻帶走。</p>\n<img alt=\"網上片段拍攝到狗狗在酷暑下被綁天台。FB：Tyrace Tsang@走失協尋香港\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adeceed6d1dc0cd8bf192965662ec713/2026-06/vlcsnap-2026-06-29-20h29m28s466.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"網上片段拍攝到狗狗在酷暑下被綁天台。FB：Tyrace Tsang@走失協尋香港\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5866b221e66efd8a3cf3e0c121377564/2026-06/vlcsnap-2026-06-29-20h29m14s605.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"狗狗毛髮稀疏。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f8cdca05453516c0ff9dd228e824222e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方接報到場調查，在同一大廈單位尋獲女狗主。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/19fd78a2259bce279fc6b8eb47d22475/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_48.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女狗主聲稱狗狗有皮膚病。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/24f60baf69c555f2aaae31c4a013c3ac/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_48_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員抱起狗狗檢查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aa3993588ed6da0112024646cda176c4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_45.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員抱起狗狗檢查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/20e31b21feea7f30fc1cf36d24306dea/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"天台角落有一盆狗糧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/18fec46329e7add9a7360e5f9ffb784a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"天台環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b438a4322fe600462c8f8b52a04f5961/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_48_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為石蔭路63號金祿樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f33389d175b031ecf8b3491bfeb0c37/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_18_21_52_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場消息指，警方調查期間在同一大廈單位找到女狗主，對方聲稱狗隻是因患有皮膚病要剃毛搽藥，因而才毛髮稀疏，又強調有擺放食水食糧。警方愛協經檢查，發現狗隻雖然體重正常，但疑已被綁住一段時間，且活動空間有限，因而須進一步調查。其後女狗主被警方帶走，目前案件暫被列作「殘酷對待動物」跟進。</p>\n<img alt=\"女狗主其後被警方帶走。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1d8825d0854b6439b757a79a18d4901a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_20_13_27.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狗狗為一隻雪橇犬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5e22d80c0195a87860bafd2a97b49c5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_20_13_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狗狗為一隻雪橇犬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2a9bedc930f26bca0e7aec0e6b4a2e2a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_20_13_07_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協將狗隻帶走照顧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1ca1275767b6c9ede7e5b891fec5a33b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_20_13_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協將狗隻帶走照顧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/51b2f5dde06dd3b567d153be0ace84a7/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_20_13_05.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T12:59:14.185997+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}